  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#the-bdi-element says:\r\n\r\n> Contexts in which this element can be used:\r\n>     Where **_phrasing content_** is expected.\r\n> \r\nHowever, not all elements categorized as \"**_phrasing content_**\" can accept _bdi_. E.g. neither _input_ nor _textarea_.\r\nThis should be reflected in the spec.",
